{"sections":[{"slug":"帽积","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"帽积"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">帽积</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“帽积”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">拓扑空间</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的帽积</span> (cap product) <span lang=\"zh\">是一个双线性映射</span>\n$$\r\nH^p(X) \\otimes H_{p+q}(X) \\to H_q(X).\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">设上同调类</span> $[f]\\in H^p(X)$, <span lang=\"zh\">有代表元</span> $f\\colon X \\to \\Sigma^p H\\mathbb{Z}$; <span lang=\"zh\">同调类</span> $[\\phi]\\in H_{p+q}(X)$, <span lang=\"zh\">有代表元</span> $\\phi\\colon S^{p+q}\\to H\\mathbb{Z}\\wedge X$. <span lang=\"zh\">两者的帽积定义为</span>\n$$\r\nS^{p+q}\\overset{\\phi}{\\to} H\\mathbb{Z}\\wedge X\\overset{\\Delta}{\\to} H\\mathbb{Z}\\wedge X\\wedge X \\overset{f}{\\to} H\\mathbb{Z}\\wedge \\Sigma^p H\\mathbb{Z}\\wedge X\\to \\Sigma^p H\\mathbb{Z}\\wedge X.\r\n$$</p>\n"}}}]}